start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc 15dc@ring ss@top
R2: {3ch=dc dc}@same 2ch sk [2dc@st 2ch sk]x7 ss@top
R3: ch [sc@sp 5dc@sp]x8 ss@top # sc in the space between the 2 dc of a pair
R4: ch sc@same [3ch 5sk sc]x7 3ch 5sk ss@top
R5: {vs vs}@sp [{vs vs}@sp]x7 ss@top # first V st = beg 5 ch (3 ch as dc + 2 ch) + dc
R6: sl@sp {vs 2ch vs}@same [[vs@sp]x3 {vs 2ch vs}@sp]x3 [vs@sp]x3 ss@top # first V st = beg 5 ch + dc
R7: {3ch=dc 2dc 2ch 3dc}@corner [[3dc@sp]x5 {3dc 2ch 3dc}@corner]x3 [3dc@sp]x5 ss@top
